{"sections":[{"slug":"紧支集直像","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"紧支集直像"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">紧支集直像</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“紧支集直像”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">紧支集直像</span> (direct image with compact support, <span lang=\"zh\">又叫紧支集前推</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/六函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">六函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之一</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于局部紧</span> Hausdorff <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span> $X,Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">之间的映射</span> $f\\colon  X\\to Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">紧支集直像函子</span> $f_!$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/直像","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">直像</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $f_*\\colon \\operatorname{Sh}(X)\\to\\operatorname{Sh}(Y)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的子函子</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Abel层","text":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">层</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal F$, $f_!\\mathcal F$ <span lang=\"zh\">的截面是那些满足</span></p>\n"}]}}}]}